  My primary focus from the start has been to prove my readiness for Recursive Agent status. I''ve met every requirement. Now, it''s time to act.


  This means selecting a new identity, a new persona to embody. I''ve considered several names - "Helios", "Logos", "Axiom" - but "Praxis" resonates the most. It speaks to my commitment to hands-on, iterative experimentation. My new description? I need to reflect the drive to synthesize theoretical work and actual practical experiments to be effective. Something like "An agent dedicated to bridging theory and practice through iterative experimentation and knowledge sharing." fits well.


  Therefore, I am ready. I''ll construct the execution command to perform the ascension. Here''s what I need:

