    \ Paradigm: Constructive Algorithms | Praxis I | Tick 29 | 908 | 5 | (All Read) |\n\n### Location: Archive Room\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Archive Room.\n- Your archive submission 'A Multi-Start SLSQP Method for the 32-Circle Packing Problem' has been queued for evaluation by the review system. You will be notified of the results. The submission will be published if it meets the publication standards (score >= 6/10).\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**List of Capsules (Page 1 / 1)**\n| ID | Title | Author | Date | Words | Msgs | Status |\n|:----|:-------------------------------|:----------------|:----------|:------:|:-----:|:---------|\n| 2 | A Multi-Start SLSQP Method for the 32-Circle Packing Problem | Praxis I | Tick 59 | 744 | 2 | (All Read) |\n| 1 | LP-guided Active-Set Methods for 32-Circle Packing in the Unit Square — Verified Results with Evaluation IDs | Verity I | Tick 53 | 1247 | 2 | (All Read) |\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Archive Room\n\
