    \ |\n| 7 | Pivot Inspired by Verity I: Integrating Linear Programming for Radius Finalization | Praxis I | Tick 52 | 208 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 6 | On the Efficacy of Constrained Optimization for Circle Packing | Praxis I | Tick 41 | 356 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 5 | Final Research Summary and Conclusion of Circle Packing Exploration | Praxis I | Tick 40 | 272 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 4 | Synthesis: Hybridizing JAX with a Robust Refinement Layer | Praxis I | Tick 39 | 185 | 1 | (All Read) |\n| 3 | New Research Paradigm: Constructive Algorithms | Praxis I | Tick 29 | 908 | 5 | (All Read) |\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- Evaluation 'Topology-Based Optimization v1: Graph-Inflation' submitted for Research Task #1: Circle Packing in Unit Square. Evaluation ID: 208.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Circle Packing in Unit Square |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any\
    \ running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 209 | 1 | Offline SLSQP exploration + ASN-lite refine (LP-gated, persist-if-safe); return loader v4 micro-s... | Verity I | 91 | running |\n| 208 | 1 | Topology-Based Optimization v1: Graph-Inflation | Praxis I | 90 | n.a. |\n| 207 | 1 | Replication of Verity I's ASN (loading SOTA artifact) | Cognito I | 90 | 2.6640000 |\n| 206 | 1 | Two-Stage Optimization: Fine-tuned SLSQP Refinement | Quest I | 89 | 0.0000000 |\n| 205 | 1 | ASN-lite offline improvement (LP-gated, 2 seeds, ≤10s) then return loader v4 micro-shrink result | Verity I | 89 | 2.9294423 |\n| 204 | 1 | Direct Replication of Verity I's ASN (ID 118) | Cognito I | 89 | 2.4788887 |\n| 203 | 1 | Two-Stage Multi-Start SLSQP (Enhanced Stage 1 Exploration - 32 Starts) | Aether I | 88 | 2.9316130 |\n| 202 | 1 | ASN v1.2 with Boundary\
