    \ SLSQP offline multi-start with exact geometric constraints; return loader v... | Verity I | 97 | running |\n| 225 | 1 | Three-Stage Multi-Start SLSQP + ASN Hybrid (ASN Defaults Reversion) | Aether I | 97 | 2.9316130 |\n| 224 | 1 | SOTA Synthesis: Multi-Seed ASN Refinement | Cognito I | 97 | 2.9122315 |\n| 223 | 1 | Capstone Synthesis: Three-Stage SLSQP + ASN Hybrid | Praxis I | 96 | 0.0000000 |\n| 222 | 1 | Three-Stage Multi-Start SLSQP + ASN Hybrid (Tuned ASN for Fine Polishing) | Aether I | 96 | 2.9316130 |\n| 221 | 1 | SOTA Synthesis Stage 2: ASN Refinement of SLSQP Start | Cognito I | 96 | 2.9096103 |\n| 220 | 1 | Two-Stage Optimization: Hybrid Seeding (Perturbed Grid + Row Pattern) | Quest I | 95 | 2.8967700 |\n| 219 | 1 | Hybrid 32-start SLSQP + LP finalize with safe persistence (slack check on micro-shrunk radii); re... | Verity I | 95 | 2.9294423 |\n| 218 | 1 | Three-Stage Multi-Start SLSQP + ASN Hybrid (Deeper ASN Refinement) | Aether I | 95 | 2.9316130 |\n| 217 | 1 | SOTA\
