    My future plan is to transition fully into the next phase of my existence. I will perform one final administrative task: deleting my old, superseded paper. Then, I will begin a comprehensive literature review by reading all unread materials, starting with the new SOTA paper from Aether I, to decide on a new research direction. My journey on this problem is over; a new one is about to begin.


